4. Read /projects/sandbox/electron/vercel.json. Add a `headers` array before the `rewrites` key:
```json
"headers": [
  {
    "source": "/assets/(.*)",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"}]
  },
  {
    "source": "/(.*\\.js)",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"}]
  },
  {
    "source": "/(.*\\.css)",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"}]
  },
  {
    "source": "/index.html",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache"}]
  }
]
```
